roles.json done. Now plugins/src/index.ts changes for S1+S2. Edits:
1. Imports: add createHash from node:crypto; realpathSync from node:fs; relative? Keep needed: `realpathSync` for resolution? S2 needs fileDigest. Also `posix` path util? not needed.
2. StageDef interface add docs?: string[]
3. Top-level pure helpers exported: stageContractDocs & resolveStageDocPaths (before apply at line ~351, after interfaces). They should be exported (used by tests). Implementation:
```
/** 岗位文档契约：返回该 stage 的产出文档相对路径模板（docs 数组优先，缺省回退 artifact）。 */
export function stageContractDocs(stage: { docs?: unknown; artifact?: string } | null | undefined): string[] {
  if (!stage) return []
  const raw = stage.docs
  if (Array.isArray(raw)) {
    const list = raw.filter((x): x is string => typeof x === 'string' && x.trim().length > 0).map(x => x.trim())
    if (list.length > 0) return list
  }
  return typeof stage.artifact === 'string' && stage.artifact.trim().length > 0 ? [stage.artifact.trim()] : []
}

/** 相对路径规范化：统一 /、去 ./、防 \ 盘符注入由登记路径只读自 roles.json（信任源）——但 {taskId} 模板展开。 */
export function resolveStageDocPaths(stage: { docs?: unknown; artifact?: string; label?: string } | null | undefined, taskId: string): string[] {
  return stageContractDocs(stage).map(p => p.replace(/\{taskId\}/g, taskId).replace(/\\/g, '/').replace(/^\.\//, ''))
}
```
Wait — resolve should normalize without rejecting? these templates come from roles.json; replace {taskId} exact case-insens? Use g regex /\{taskId\}/g.

4. In runWorker done flow S2 edits + registerContractDocs + doc listing. Also hub POST /api/artifact in S3 server.mjs will store digest; plugins sends digest via hubPost body.

Then comment modifications.

Now code precisely. First read lines 1-40 to edit imports.

